module lib/hf/tests/guess
  The checks of lib/hf/guess against reference data, and their helpers.

gs_t_opts  @82d9a56c
  why    The tests run each guess with each orthogonalizer and eigensolver;
         this builds the options array for one combination.
  k      the guess member
  orth   the orthogonalizer member
  eig    the eigensolver member
  na     the number of alpha electrons
  nb     the number of beta electrons

gs_t_run  @8197fbb9
  why    Shortens the tests: one guess on reference integrals.
  H      the one-electron Hamiltonian
  S      the overlap matrix
  Gp     the packed integrals
  k      the guess member
  na     the number of alpha electrons
  nb     the number of beta electrons
  n      the number of basis functions
